00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:50.760
And...

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.050
Tenten-san fed this to Koushi-kun.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.210
That is...!

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.990
<i>What did you make him eat!?</i>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:02.940
<i>Chinu no putomain.</i>

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.670
<i>You have one more week to live.</i>

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.970
<i>If you think I'm lying, show those to the poison expert, Iroha-chan.</i>

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:15.250
<i>Too bad I won't be able to see Iroha-chan's expression.</i>

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.670
<i>If you are done, let's go home.</i>

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.770
<i>The fun is only starting.</i>

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.560
<i>Hey, Koushi-chan, you don't want to die, right?</i>

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:26.270
<i>If that's the case, come to the Koganei village after seven days.</i>

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.870
<i>I'll make the antidote for you.</i>

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.100
<i>But you have to earn it.</i>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.740
<i>I'll give it to you if you fight us and win.</i>

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.030
<i>Hear that?</i>

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.850
<i>Remember to bring Tenka too.</i>

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.480
<i>He needs to be taught a lesson.</i>

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.300
<i>Iroha-chan too.</i>

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.340
<i>I can't wait to see her.</i>

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:44.450
I've analyzed this.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.050
This is unmistakably...

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.090
...the secret poison of our clan...

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:49.780
Chinu no putomain.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:56.380
Chinu no Putomain

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.230
To tell you the truth.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:56.380
Koganei Tenten has stolen secrets from our clan.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.990
If this is the same as the ones from our clan, making the antidote would be easy.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:02.440
But...

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.260
This was modified in some way.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.780
I can't do anything without knowing the ingredients of the poison.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.100
In other words...

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.610
Koganei Tenten is the only one who can make the antidote.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:17.070
I'm sorry I can't help you...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.010
It's alright, sis.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.780
Let's beat the crap out of them and get the antidote!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.660
I will make up for what my sister did.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.270
We can win if we combine our strength!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:27.740
Yeah.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.560
Well said, Hanzo.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.770
Though there is no way Koushi senpai can lose, it'll be perfect with our help.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.340
That's right, that's right.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.750
Thank you, everyone.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:37.790
I too...

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.510
What a joke.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:47.680
Together With Fate

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.780
What do you mean by "what a joke"?

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.320
They are really strong, aren't they?

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:55.780
There is no reason for you guys to risk your lives for me.

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.700
Just leave me to die.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:00.900
Give me a break!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:02.590
Get a hold of yourself!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.850
What hope is there if even you give up?

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.430
Stop! Stop it, Hanzo!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.490
It's my siblings' fault that this is happening...

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.720
But you need to be more determined.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.830
A lot has happened between us.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.000
But I really thought of you as a friend.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:24.350
But...

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.170
At this rate, everyone will be gone.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:34.360
Get out of here.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:35.960
You too.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.840
Actually, I've met the oldest of the Koganei brothers.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.730
He is terrifying beyond my imagination.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.240
But I will defeat him for sure.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.570
Even if I have to risk my life.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.110
Give it up.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:58.290
You are just feeling sorry for me after I believed in Kinu-san, aren't you?

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.610
There are things I'm not telling you too.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.190
Things have turned weird ever since you came over.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.640
Troublesome.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:07.740
Tiresome.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:08.900
Annoying.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.370
Depressing.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.450
I've wanted to ask you to leave countless times.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:13.700
Everything...

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.520
It's all your fault!

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.670
I wish you didn't come here!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.090
Well...

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.230
I'll be going to the other world after seven days.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.650
It will be our farewell.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:31.320
Wha...

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:32.630
What?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.240
No matter where...

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.260
Hey.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:40.920
Wha...

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:41.800
Id... Idiot...

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.340
Don't!

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.690
Spit it out!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:48.770
This can't be...

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.290
I'll follow you to the other world.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.190
You...

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:58.570
You are really an idiot.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.240
Even if the whole world abandons you...

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.850
I won't leave you alone.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:06.350
Okay?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.680
You should've just left me...

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.120
Someone like me...

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.350
Who has a big mouth...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:13.980
But I'm really...

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:15.900
...really...

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.220
...scared.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.690
I don't want to die.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.760
I want someone to save me.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.870
But I couldn't say it.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.790
I don't know what's wrong anymore.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:27.040
Shit...

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:28.360
I'm sorry.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:29.770
I'm sorry...

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:35.580
Thank you...

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:39.510
That's what happened.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.330
About yesterday...

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.530
Sorry about everything.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.060
So again...

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.980
Please lend us your help.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.550
It's alright.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.620
We'll fight them.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.070
Lend us some time, let's do martial arts trainings.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.080
Yeah!

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:56.870
Thank you so much.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.600
Let's train like mad for the next six days!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.040
Everyone...

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:01.960
I...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.530
There is something I want to try.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.180
I want to try the scroll my old man gave me after the fire.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.130
No way...

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.540
No way...

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.930
Inuzuka-kun is...

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:17.650
One week...

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.200
They are going in a week.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.710
What are you going to do?

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:24.690
I'm sorry, grandma.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:26.850
I have a request.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.150
The blood of a martial artist runs through my veins.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.440
So I should be able to do it too.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.330
First release the chakura in your eyes.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.030
Note: I think most people already know what "chakura" is, in case you don't, think of it as qi.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.030
Chakura?

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:39.690
Next...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.550
Next, form a seal.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:42.800
Ten...

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:43.650
...jou...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:44.370
...ten...

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:44.900
...ge...

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:45.780
Yui...

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:46.600
...ga...

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:47.480
...dokuson!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.000
And say them out loud.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.480
I presume the technique has worked.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:57.270
I can't...

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.340
Calm down...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.260
To meet everyone's expectations...

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.330
...and to answer her feelings...

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:03.960
I'll do it.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.280
I have to do it.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.480
Eye technique basics.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:08.640
This is it.

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:09.830
If I have this...

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.810
Step 1: Shoot down a bird with your eyes.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.170
That's the home to the Koganei clan, Mount Souhon.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.710
The time has finally come.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.760
To the final battle!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.290
Koushi senpai, it looks like you went through some tough trainings.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.390
I'm feeling confident in you.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:36.520
Yeah.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:40.070
I've spent days and nights memorizing the scroll.

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.360
And then I...

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.000
Kill your enemy with your eyes.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.950
Kill with my eyes. Kill with my eyes. Kill with my eyes. Kill with my eyes.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:48.860
Kill...

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:49.890
...with my eyes!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.630
Ouch... Ou, ou, ou...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.740
I don't even know what's there to understand.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.910
What can I do to tigers if I can't even win against birds?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:05.620
This place...

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.060
Welcome to the playground.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.270
Koganei Tenten presents...

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:20.540
...the fun and exciting dueling game!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.480
Koganei Tenten!

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.590
Playground? Game?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.940
Quit playing and give us the antidote!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.540
Fight with me!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:29.610
Right now!

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.400
No no no.

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.530
It'll be boring if it ends too quickly.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.010
Let's have one on one fights.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:40.010
There are three components to the antidote, each one of us holds one.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:45.750
After each victory, you receive one component of the antidote, and you'll even receive some candies.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:50.710
You can make the antidote after you defeat our big brother, Tenga.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.390
Don't move.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.830
I won't give you the antidote if you do.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.320
Oh my...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.650
It's already like this.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.880
It's now the seventh day.

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.670
Poor thing.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.740
There there.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.640
It's alright.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.710
He'll be saved once he drinks the antidote.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.470
But if he doesn't...

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.450
He'll die by sunset.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.020
By sunset...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.530
So let's get started already.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.560
In that case, let's start the first match!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.290
Representing Koganei team...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:40.250
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Koganei Tenrei

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:40.310
Born to the Koganei branch family, Koganei Tenrei!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.140
I'll take over from here.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:44.460
Tenka-dono!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.440
You guys don't know anything about him.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.100
Leave it to me.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.800
Inuzuka team, Koganei Tenka!

